OL,3,GNEWSA'The storm didn't ruin our
OL,4,Awedding, it made it'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple whose wedding day coincided
OL,7,Fwith Storm Boelo said last-minute
OL,8,Fchanges caused by the weather did not
OL,9,Fruin their day, "it made it".
OL,11,FLeigh and Paul Hutchinson had planned
OL,12,Fto surprise their wedding guests with a
OL,13,Fglass of fizz at the top of Blackpool
OL,14,FTower, but high winds forced the venue
OL,15,Fto close the area.
OL,17,FInstead, staff arranged a private bar
OL,18,Fon the upper balcony of the Tower
OL,19,FBallroom and later cleared the dance
OL,20,Ffloor so the newlyweds could share
OL,21,Ftheir first dance there.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
